---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "去中国带什么行李——季节与气候指南";
const description = "根据季节和城市来决定带什么——从北京冬天到广州夏天。";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/zh/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        ← 返回生活指南
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🎒 中国生活</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        去中国带什么行李：季节与气候指南
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">中国的气候差异大——这份清单告诉你到底需要带什么。</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 最后更新：2026年6月</span>
        <span>⏱️ 阅读时间：6分钟</span>
      </div>
    </header>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">🎯 快速回答</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed">
        <strong>中国气候差异极大。</strong>北京冬天能到零下10°C，广州夏天湿热35°C+。关键是分层穿衣，看你去哪个城市、什么季节。不管什么时候去，舒适的走路鞋、充电宝、纸巾、可重复使用的水瓶都是必备。
      </p>
    </div>

        <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 本指南目录</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#year-round" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎒 全年必备</a></li>
        <li><a href="#spring" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🌸 春季（3–5月）</a></li>
        <li><a href="#summer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">☀️ 夏季（6–8月）</a></li>
        <li><a href="#autumn" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍂 秋季（9–11月）</a></li>
        <li><a href="#winter" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">❄️ 冬季（12–2月）</a></li>
        <li><a href="#city-guide" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏙️ 各城市速查</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="year-round" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🎒</span> 全年必备
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8">不管什么季节去中国，这些东西都应该带上：</p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <caption class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic mb-2">中国旅行季节性装箱指南</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">物品</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">为什么</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>充电宝</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">导航+翻译+支付，手机耗电很快</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>万能转换插头</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">中国用A/I型插座（220V）</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>随身纸巾/湿巾</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">很多公厕不提供纸巾</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>免洗洗手液</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">不是所有地方都有洗手液</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>可重复使用水杯</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">酒店和车站都有热水供应</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>舒适的步行鞋</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">每天轻松走15000步以上</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>小背包/双肩包</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">不是所有景点都让带大包</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>护照和签证复印件</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">电子版也存一份</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>重要提醒：</strong>国内航班和高铁安检要求充电宝必须有3C认证标志，容量不超过20000mAh。如果计划去多个城市，建议在抵达的第一个城市买一个合规的充电宝。</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="spring" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🌸</span> 春季（3–5月）
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>温度：</strong>10°C–25°C（北京偏凉，广州偏暖）</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>特点：</strong>温和但变化大。4–5月多雨，尤其南方。</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">建议带：</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 薄外套或卫衣（必带——春天晚上还是挺凉的）</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 长裤和长袖上衣</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 雨伞或轻便雨衣</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 围巾（挡风防尘）</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="summer" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">☀️</span> 夏季（6–8月）
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>温度：</strong>25°C–40°C（北京干热，广州/上海湿热）</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>特点：</strong>全国都热，南方城市特别潮湿，季风雨常见。</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">建议带：</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 轻薄透气的衣服（棉、麻）</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 防晒霜（SPF 50+）</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 太阳镜和帽子</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 雨伞（遮阳挡雨两用）</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-red-500">⚠️</span> 故宫、长城很多地方没遮阴——提前做好防晒准备</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="autumn" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🍂</span> 秋季（9–11月）
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>温度：</strong>5°C–22°C（渐凉，舒适）</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>特点：</strong>最舒服的季节。天空通透，空气清爽，湿度低。</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">建议带：</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 分层穿搭：T恤+薄外套或毛衣</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 牛仔裤或舒适长裤</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 中等厚度的外套供晚上穿</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 户外活动最理想的季节</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="winter" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">❄️</span> 冬季（12–2月）
      </h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>温度：</strong>-15°C（北京/哈尔滨）到15°C（广州/深圳）</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>特点：</strong>北方冰天雪地，南方温和。干燥，湿度低。</p>

      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">去北方建议带（南方跟秋天一样穿）：</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 厚羽绒服/防寒大衣（北京、西安及以北必须）</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 保暖内衣（如果去北方）</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 帽子、手套、围巾——冬天没商量的余地</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 润唇膏和保湿霜（暖气让皮肤很干）</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-red-500">⚠️</span> 哈尔滨能到零下30°C——去那么北的话要准备极寒装备</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />

            <h2 id="city-guide" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="text-4xl">🏙️</span> 各城市速查
      </h2>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <caption class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic mb-2">中国各城市气候对比</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">城市</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">夏季 (°C)</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">冬季 (°C)</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">关键装箱建议</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">北京</td><td class="px-6 py-4">25–35</td><td class="px-6 py-4">-10 to 5</td><td class="px-6 py-4">冬天厚外套，夏天注意防晒</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">上海</td><td class="px-6 py-4">25–37</td><td class="px-6 py-4">0–10</td><td class="px-6 py-4">全年潮湿；雨衣必备</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">广州</td><td class="px-6 py-4">28–38</td><td class="px-6 py-4">10–18</td><td class="px-6 py-4">全年温暖；轻薄衣物+雨具</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">深圳</td><td class="px-6 py-4">28–35</td><td class="px-6 py-4">12–20</td><td class="px-6 py-4">类似广州；夏天可以带泳装</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">成都</td><td class="px-6 py-4">22–32</td><td class="px-6 py-4">2–10</td><td class="px-6 py-4">经常阴天；全年适合叠穿</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">西安</td><td class="px-6 py-4">23–35</td><td class="px-6 py-4">-5 to 8</td><td class="px-6 py-4">类似北京但稍暖</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
          <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-6 mt-8">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-50 to-blue-50 border border-brand-100 rounded-xl p-5 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">📚 继续阅读</h3>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="/zh/life/essential-apps/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              📱 去中国必装10个App
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/zh/transport/transport-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">
              🚄 中国出行指南
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    </div>
  
  </article>
</Layout>